OL,3,GNEWSAHope docks' silt crisis could soon
OL,4,Abe over                                
OL,6,F"We've had to work our way into the    
OL,7,Fdock space, but now... we should see a 
OL,8,Ffurther mobilisation of a dredging     
OL,9,Fteam," he said.                        
